OL,3,ABurnham pressed on economy at first
OL,4,APMQs as UK borrowing costs rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham became prime minister in July,
OL,7,Fhaving taken over from Sir Keir Starmer
OL,8,Fjust before Parliament's summer recess,
OL,9,Fand it was the first time he had faced
OL,10,Fthe Tory leader at the Commons session.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
